# Every text file keeps LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says
# (Git for Windows sets it to true): the files are built and run in Linux
# containers, where a CR breaks a shell script. deploy/initdb/ with CRLF stops
# PostgreSQL's first start at "$'\r': command not found".
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe's own.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
